# save: 15-Desert
# Dusty Dunes: out of the drugstore onto the sand, walk the desert with enemies on (encounters,
# heat), then A tapped through whatever battle or text that brings
# The door load: the first emu sample is part-way in (skip) and its fade-in ends a CPU-time frame
# later in the original (lag)
# skip: 32
# lag: 52
# EVENT_1's sunstroke check runs every 1200 frames from the file load, and the 2 boots reach the
# seed a few logic frames apart (the original's setup waits are wall frames, some of them lag
# frames in this drugstore): the port's extra frames before the teleport put its check on the
# original's frame
port: wait 3
teleport 7887 2168 0; wait 10; until idle 300
